{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What is Dark Quest 4?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dark Quest 4 is a turn based dungeon crawler where you create a party of 3 heroes and go on epic quests.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Campaign with hand made quests with over 20 hours of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer up to 3 people</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn based combat and movement system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level editor to make stand alone quests or a campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam Workshop integration to share your creations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Animated figurines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique art world that looks, feels and plays like a tabletop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Voice over for the sorcerer playing the role of the Dungeon Master</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/DarkQuest_Lightning_Gif.gif?t=1743079261\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Inspirations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is heavily inspired by dungeon crawler board games such as Hero Quest, Descent 2nd edition, Dungeon Saga and others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dark Quest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Its a game of your imagination!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2453840?t=1743079261","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743079261","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/2d97b757cee9c9626f8c56a418d8c865a29a1a00/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743079261","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/2d97b757cee9c9626f8c56a418d8c8